View" bounds="[96,858][1184,998]" clickable="false" focused="false" a11y-focused="false" /><node text="" content-desc="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" bounds="[48,1028][1232,1372]" clickable="false" focused="false" a11y-focused="false" /><node text="" content-desc="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" bounds="[96,1028][1232,1030]" clickable="false" focused="false" a11y-focused="false" /><node text="为什么扩展时才做目标测试？" content-desc="" class="android.widget.TextView" bounds="[96,1058][1184,1126]" clickable="false" focused="false" a11y-focused="false" /><node text="生成时第一个碰到的目标路径不一定最便宜；只有作为边界中代价最小的节点被取出时，才确定它最优。（仍有点模糊，已记为卡点）" content-desc="" class="android.widget.TextView" bounds="[96,1132][1184,1342]" clickable="false" focused="false" a11y-focused="false" /><node text="卡点" content-desc="" class="android.view.View" bounds="[96,1444][174,1501]" clickable="false" focused="false" a11y-focused="false" /><node text="" content-desc="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" bounds="[48,1522][1232,1650]" clickable="false" focused="false" a11y-focused="false" /><node text="" content-desc="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" bounds="[48,1522][1232,1650]" clickable="false" focused="false" a11y-focused="false" /><node text="为什么目标测试要放在扩展时，而不是生成时" content-desc="" class="android.widget.TextView" bounds="[96,1552][1184,1620]" clickable="false" focused="false" a11y-focused="false" /><node text="高亮" content-desc="" class="android.view.View" bounds="[96,1722][174,1779]" clickable="false" focused="false" a11y-focused="false" /><node text="" content-desc="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" bounds="[48,1800][1232,2232]" clickable="false" focused="false" a11y-focused="false" /><node text="" content-desc="打开高亮 p.91" class="android.widget.Button" bounds="[48,1800][1232,2232]" clickable="true" focused="false" a11y-focused="false" /><node text="[示意内容] 一致代价搜索像水面上的波纹一样，按路径代价一圈一圈向外扩展。它在节点被扩展时才做目标测试，而不是在节点被生成时：先生成的到达目标的路径，不一定是代价最小的那条。" content-desc="" class="android.widget.TextView" bounds="[96,1830][1184,2142]" clickabl